   "sha256": "cd573825d657a3f6fdae41d0a47c3f02f538b9a24dbe41dcf52633d0107af167",
   "purpose": "Engine bridge integration: (1) expose @hypit/cli build-planning pipeline (createCatalogDescriptor, evaluatePlanNeeds, describePlan*, assertPlannedRequests, assertPreflight, preflightPlan) and checkRunFile so the sidecar composes Build requests in-process instead of parsing CLI output; (2) package-loader readPackage treats permission-denied reads as package-not-found so the sandboxed runner's ancestor node_modules walks terminate instead of aborting resolution. Pure additive/defensive; upstream behavior unchanged without denials.",
